<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00223/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一桶盛有约250ml面汤的泡面，底部不可见。可以不断地从中捞出面渣与脱水蔬菜。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>位于Site-CN-██的生物实验室内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>一次测试中将面汤倒出后失去异常性质。后将面汤倒回并冷藏。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>虽然因为违反实验室规定而扣了工资，但我没喝汤就吃饱这可是第一次。</em>——Dr.Kalis<br />
<em>然后为了检测同一批泡面是否异常，半个部门的人被鼓励着吃了三天泡面。</em>——Dr.Lujeff</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00223" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00223" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00223-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lujeff-kalis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5460271); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5460271&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609403226" alt="Lujeff Kalis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5460271)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lujeff-kalis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5460271); return false;">Lujeff Kalis</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590758040 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">29 May 2020 13:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00225/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述:</strong>一沓不明活动的奖券，共<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">7</span>5张被刮开后所中的奖品会被奖券生成并落入刮奖者的口袋里。目前最高奖项为W特工开出的iPhone 11 Pro Max。<br />
<strong>回收日期:</strong>20██/██/██。<br />
<strong>回收地点:</strong>Dr.NineTree的工作室中。<br />
<strong>当前状态:</strong>还剩下5张。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>诶，我什么时候有的iPhone 11 Pro Max？我发财了！！！ ——特工W</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>老天爷，为什么我是一本《英语速成手册》？我不需要这玩意儿！！！</p>
</blockquote>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00225" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00225" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00225-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentlq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6140401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6140401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609403226" alt="agentLQ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6140401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentlq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6140401); return false;">agentLQ</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590888895 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">31 May 2020 01:34</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00335" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00335-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609403226" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1595921948 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Jul 2020 07:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00287/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支██牌中性笔，其笔盖在落至地面后将会消失，并且使笔的使用者产生强烈的寻找其的冲动，在笔的主人更换后笔盖会重新出现于新主人的附近<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.Leon的办公桌上<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被存放于site-47低危物品收容柜内<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>然后为了检查同一批次中性笔有无异常，我被逼着摔了一个星期的笔盖-Dr.Leon</em><br />
<em>这是你找笔盖找了五个小时文书工作一笔没动的报应-site主管尹██</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00287" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00287" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00287-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leonswangsx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6522014); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6522014&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609403226" alt="LeonSwangsx" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6522014)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leonswangsx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6522014); return false;">LeonSwangsx</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593148969 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Jun 2020 05:22</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00241/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目为一个挂钟，当有不超过2人注视它时，它的时间将会自动变为注视者所要做的下一件事的1小时前<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> Dr. Fox的家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong> 被储存于site-CN-██的低价值物品储存柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><br />
<em>主管你听我解释我真不是故意迟到的啊喂！</em><br />
<em>———Dr. Fox</em></p>
<p><em>没人会迟到19个小时的，Dr.Fox</em><br />
<em>———站点主管████</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00241" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00241" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00241-hovertip">
